274
00:14:27,479 --> 00:14:53,479
I don't know anymore. What's right? What's wrong? The only thing I can tell is Fakir isn't lying. I didn't see it. But this whole time, Fakir's been the same as me. No. He might care about MUTO even more than I do.

275
00:14:56,479 --> 00:15:03,479
Oh, it's you. Sorry you've caught me in a bad moment.

276
00:15:04,479 --> 00:15:05,479
What?

277
00:15:05,479 --> 00:15:08,479
You're crying. What, for my sake?

278
00:15:08,479 --> 00:15:29,479
Take it. You wanted it, didn't you? I will not acknowledge you, Princess Tutu.

279
00:15:29,479 --> 00:15:30,479
Fakir.

280
00:15:30,479 --> 00:15:35,479
Oh, that's right. There's a shard at Karin's house.

281
00:15:35,479 --> 00:15:39,479
Was this really the right thing to do?

282
00:15:39,479 --> 00:15:44,479
There's no way to know that. No matter what you do, you'll only regret it.

283
00:15:44,479 --> 00:15:45,479
You're right.

284
00:15:45,479 --> 00:15:48,479
Just as I thought.

285
00:15:48,479 --> 00:15:55,479
Come. If you don't hurry, the wedding will start without you.

286
00:16:09,479 --> 00:16:10,479
Mr. Karin.

287
00:16:10,479 --> 00:16:17,479
Huh? Princess Tutu? Could it really be?

288
00:16:18,479 --> 00:16:22,479
Please come dance with me, Mr. Karin.

289
00:16:22,479 --> 00:16:29,479
So the tale truly has sprung back to life here in our day. But I still do not know what it is I should do.

290
00:16:29,479 --> 00:16:42,479
I've always regretted telling Fakir the legend. I regret having hurt Fakir. The only things I can do for that child are things that I regret.

291
00:16:42,479 --> 00:16:46,479
No. You should be able to have faith in him.

292
00:16:46,479 --> 00:16:47,479
Have faith in him?

293
00:16:47,479 --> 00:16:58,479
Yes. If Fakir journeys down the path of his heart's conviction, I do not believe he'll regret it, whatever the outcome. Why not have faith in Fakir?

294
00:16:58,479 --> 00:17:04,479
Have faith in Fakir. I am the feeling of regret.

295
00:17:06,479 --> 00:17:11,479
Princess Tutu, thank you. My doubts have cleared.

296
00:17:11,479 --> 00:17:18,479
A book is not a thing to be feared. Turn this page with your own hand.

297
00:17:27,479 --> 00:17:34,479
No way. No way will I succumb to such a miserable fate. I'll change it.

298
00:17:41,479 --> 00:17:44,479
My prince. Princess Tutu.

299
00:17:44,479 --> 00:17:45,479
Princess Tutu.

300
00:17:47,479 --> 00:17:49,479
I've brought you a shard of your heart.

301
00:17:49,479 --> 00:17:50,479
Thank you.

302
00:17:53,479 --> 00:17:55,479
Are you going to Krihi?

303
00:17:55,479 --> 00:17:57,479
Yes. I feel I mustn't run away.

304
00:17:58,479 --> 00:18:01,479
Thank you, Princess Tutu.

305
00:18:02,479 --> 00:18:06,479
For going to the trouble of returning the shards of my husband's heart.

306
00:18:06,479 --> 00:18:12,479
But whether you return them or not makes no difference now, for the prince will become mine tonight.

307
00:18:13,479 --> 00:18:17,479
I will have you bear witness as a nuptial sacrifice.

308
00:18:25,479 --> 00:18:28,479
I've been waiting. Do what you must.

309
00:18:29,479 --> 00:18:31,479
Leave no cause for regret.

310
00:18:31,479 --> 00:18:32,479
Karin.

311
00:18:42,479 --> 00:18:43,479
Go, my son.

312
00:18:51,479 --> 00:18:52,479
What say you, Princess Tutu?

313
00:18:53,479 --> 00:18:55,479
Aren't we just perfect for each other?

314
00:18:55,479 --> 00:19:04,479
I've prepared a special seat for you.

315
00:19:04,479 --> 00:19:05,479
Tutu.

316
00:19:06,479 --> 00:19:07,479
First, we'll have a dance.

317
00:19:08,479 --> 00:19:11,479
I could do away with Tutu this very second, but let's celebrate.

318
00:19:11,479 --> 00:19:12,479
Let's celebrate.

319
00:19:25,479 --> 00:19:29,479
My beautiful prince, you are mine.

320
00:19:30,479 --> 00:19:33,479
Krihi, who are you? Why must you demand I be yours?

321
00:19:34,479 --> 00:19:35,479
Because it is fate.

322
00:19:36,479 --> 00:19:37,479
Fate? Whose fate is that?

323
00:19:37,479 --> 00:19:45,479
It matters not whose fate it is. Fate cannot be changed, not by anyone.

324
00:19:52,479 --> 00:19:54,479
Back, you filthy raven.

325
00:19:55,479 --> 00:19:56,479
Bakir.

326
00:19:57,479 --> 00:19:58,479
So, the coward has arrived.

327
00:19:59,479 --> 00:20:00,479
Bakir.

328
00:20:00,479 --> 00:20:03,479
I will suffer you to be near Mewtwo no more!

329
00:20:07,479 --> 00:20:08,479
Krihi, stop!

330
00:20:09,479 --> 00:20:10,479
What's wrong?

331
00:20:11,479 --> 00:20:12,479
Why are you in such pain?

332
00:20:12,479 --> 00:20:13,479
Why are you in such pain?

333
00:20:31,479 --> 00:20:33,479
She has the stone back.

334
00:20:34,479 --> 00:20:38,479
What is it? Hurry and be gone! Or do you have a burning desire to settle things now?

335
00:20:38,479 --> 00:20:40,479
I don't have any wish to fight you.

336
00:20:41,479 --> 00:20:44,479
I have to hurry! Or Valkyra and Mewtwo aren't gonna catch up to me!

337
00:20:47,479 --> 00:20:50,479
If I'm caught wandering out this late, they'll be suspicious.

338
00:20:51,479 --> 00:20:52,479
What the way?

339
00:20:52,479 --> 00:20:53,479
Hey you!

340
00:20:53,479 --> 00:20:54,479
Teehee!

341
00:20:54,479 --> 00:20:55,479
Teehee!

342
00:20:55,479 --> 00:20:56,479
Nothing! What are you doing out this late?

343
00:20:57,479 --> 00:20:58,479
What am I doing?

344
00:20:58,479 --> 00:20:59,479
What am I doing?

345
00:20:59,479 --> 00:21:00,479
Well, if I'm out this late, what else could I be doing but that?

346
00:21:00,479 --> 00:21:01,479
That?

347
00:21:01,479 --> 00:21:02,479
You know, that. Well, see ya.

348
00:21:02,479 --> 00:21:03,479
Hey, what's on your... What?

349
00:21:03,479 --> 00:21:04,479
What?

350
00:21:04,479 --> 00:21:05,479
I'm just walking around here.

351
00:21:05,479 --> 00:21:06,479
If I'm caught wandering out this late, they'll be suspicious.

352
00:21:06,479 --> 00:21:07,479
What the way?

353
00:21:09,479 --> 00:21:10,479
Hey, you.

354
00:21:10,479 --> 00:21:11,479
Teehee!

355
00:21:12,479 --> 00:21:13,479
Teehee!

356
00:21:14,479 --> 00:21:15,479
Nothing!

357
00:21:15,479 --> 00:21:16,479
What are you doing out this late?

358
00:21:16,479 --> 00:21:17,479
What am I doing?

359
00:21:17,479 --> 00:21:20,479
Well, if I'm out this late, what else could I be doing but that?

360
00:21:20,479 --> 00:21:21,479
That?

361
00:21:21,479 --> 00:21:24,479
Well, if I'm out this late, what else could I be doing but that?

362
00:21:24,479 --> 00:21:25,479
That?

363
00:21:25,479 --> 00:21:28,479
You know, that. Well, see ya.

364
00:21:28,479 --> 00:21:30,479
Hey, what's on your...

365
00:21:30,479 --> 00:21:32,479
What?

366
00:21:32,479 --> 00:21:33,479
Wait!

367
00:21:33,479 --> 00:21:35,479
That pendant.

368
00:21:35,479 --> 00:21:37,479
Goodnight from here!

369
00:21:40,479 --> 00:21:42,479
Princess Tutu?

370
00:21:42,479 --> 00:21:44,479
What do I do?

371
00:21:44,479 --> 00:21:47,479
Could it be he's found out?

372
00:21:47,479 --> 00:21:51,479
Oh dear, it would appear that your identity has slipped out.

373
00:21:51,479 --> 00:21:54,479
What will you do, Princess Tutu?

374
00:23:26,262 --> 00:23:27,862
I'm surprised, to be honest.

375
00:23:27,862 --> 00:23:30,062
Of all the people, I never expected it was you.

376
00:23:30,062 --> 00:23:32,062
Tell me, Doc, do you know about Tutu?

377
00:23:32,062 --> 00:23:35,962
The one Mewtwo wants to see isn't me, it's Princess Tutu, but...

378
00:23:35,962 --> 00:23:40,262
I wish I could have stayed Rue forever, free of Krahi's memories, but now...

379
00:23:40,262 --> 00:23:42,562
The name of this gym here is love.

380
00:23:42,562 --> 00:23:44,162
I am the feeling of love.

381
00:23:44,162 --> 00:23:45,762
The feeling of love, is it?

382
00:23:45,762 --> 00:23:47,362
No, Krahi, stop!

383
00:23:48,362 --> 00:23:53,162
All you children who love stories, come gather round.

384
00:23:55,362 --> 00:24:13,362
...

385
